-- words --
`owner-guide.md` names the flow in order: hyp-grill, then run, then land, close or re-grill, and has no list of what hyp does not have yet.
-- run --
grep -o -E 'hyp-grill|re-grill|What hyp does not have yet' docs/owner-guide.md | sort -u; grep -c -E '\bclose\b' docs/owner-guide.md | sed 's/^/close named: /'
-- floor: contains --
hyp-grill
-- floor: contains --
re-grill
-- ceiling --
What hyp does not have yet
-- ceiling --
close named: 0
